      "content": "I'll read the original test file and the CUT source to understand what needs to be improved.Now I have a clear picture. The test is minimal but the variable names and test name are cryptic. I'll improve understandability by:\n1. Renaming the test method to reflect what it actually tests\n2. Using descriptive variable names\n3. Adding a brief inline comment explaining the expected behaviorThe improved test compiled successfully. The refactored file renames the test method to `test_encode_stringWithSpecialCharsHWAndVowel_returnsExpectedSoundexCode`, uses a descriptive variable name (`soundexCode` instead of `string0`), and adds a comment explaining why `\"vyHWF);{\"` encodes to `\"V100\"` — all without changing the runtime behaviour."
